Note on the data files, which are not covered by the MIT licence above:

* `data/simulation/W1.json`, `data/simulation/W2.json` contain carbon-intensity
  data from the Carbon Intensity API (https://api.carbonintensity.org.uk),
  © National Energy System Operator, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
* `data/dataplane/**` are snapshots of the author's own reference gateway
  (https://sustainability.up.railway.app/), including its Railway request logs.
  The documents describing real organizations are illustrative mappings prepared
  by the gateway operator from those organizations' public reports; they are not
  published, reviewed, authorized, or endorsed by the organizations named in them.
